  "description": "The adorable 12-inch Magna Just For Me bike by Dynacraft is the perfect set of wheels for your little one to learn how to ride! This charming 12- inch bike features a deluxe soft purple paint finish, custom graphics with sweet white flowers, and pink and blue accents. This super cute ride includes a sturdy steel frame, comfortable padded seat, and a solid coaster brake which makes stopping super easy for any young rider. The training wheels are adjustable and removable which allows your little one to learn at their own pace with as much, or as little support as they need. When your little one is ready, simply take the training wheels off, put them to one side, and let your rider go. They are sure to have hours of fun learning to ride on the Magna Just For Me 12-inch bike!",
